{"availability":"available","full":"F-e-u-e-r/starledger","name":"starledger","description":"Self-owned GitHub-stars dashboard and fail-closed export pipeline — static, no backend, no key custody.","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-06-18T06:40:16Z","updated":"2026-10-08T12:36:29Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://f-e-u-e-r.github.io/starledger/","topics":["automation","dashboard","github-pages","github-stars","react","self-hosted","typescript"],"demo":"https://f-e-u-e-r.github.io/starledger/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T18:25:58.786Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T18:25:58.786Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T18:25:58.786Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T18:25:58.786Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Self-owned GitHub-stars dashboard and fail-closed export pipeline — static, no backend, no key custody.","StarLedger is an alpha-stage, self-owned GitHub stars dashboard and discovery workflow. It exports your stars into one canonical dataset, publishes a static dashboard on GitHub Pages, and optionally adds a Telegram notifier, AI classification and a discovery inbox — all on infrastructure you own, using only your own tokens."],"features":["Fail-closed publishing. The exporter validates in a staging area and publishes in a single commit; on incomplete data, rate limits or a failed publish it defers and leaves the last good dataset untouched.","Static dashboard, no backend. A GitHub Pages site with client-side filter, sort and search that trusts only the canonical dataset; AI and discovery artifacts are loaded fail-soft when present.","Optional layers stay opt-in. Telegram notifications with no-duplicate replay, AI categories / tags / summaries / semantic search produced by an executor that runs outside this repo, and a Discovery Inbox for candidate…","No key custody. Only user-owned tokens — no StarLedger service key, central OAuth or shared backend, and no model call in CI.","Reusable template. A sanitized starter is generated deterministically from this repo, with a setup doctor and a clean-room validation runbook."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/F-e-u-e-r/starledger/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"606d2446b3bc8211ee05dccfd9fd5dc44e03d2fbe5141a8019f82480677ec5c8","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T18:25:58.931Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T18:25:58.931Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Self-owned GitHub-stars dashboard and fail-closed export pipeline — static, no backend, no key custody.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/F-e-u-e-r/starledger/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"606d2446b3bc8211ee05dccfd9fd5dc44e03d2fbe5141a8019f82480677ec5c8","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/F-e-u-e-r/starledger/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T18:25:58.932Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-08T12:36:29Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/F-e-u-e-r/starledger/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T18:25:58.932Z","hash":"606d2446b3bc8211ee05dccfd9fd5dc44e03d2fbe5141a8019f82480677ec5c8","originalBytes":11757,"storedBytes":11757,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["docs","dashboard","pnpm","discovery","github","exporter","starred","config","notifier","telegram","packages","inbox","setup","candidate","complete","export","only","stars","repo","stars.json","state","canonical","gate","schemas","when","artifact","bash","commit","doctor","filter","generated","key","node","optional","replay","reusable","run","static","template","token","validation","artifacts","build","cli","contracts","dataset","deterministic","fail-soft","full","graphql","hosted","model","p2-notifier-spec.md","p3-ai-spec.md","p4-template-spec.md","p5-discovery-inbox-spec.md","pat","published","schema","search","smoke","star","starledger","sync","validated","via","ai-schema","backend","delivery","dist","exit"